{"id":15,"titleZh":"音乐厅里的民间音乐","titleEn":"Folk Music in the Concert Hall","date":"1961-04-09","dateZh":"1961 年 4 月 9 日","concepts":"语言重音与律动、五声音阶、民歌交响拼贴","thesis":"各国音乐的“民族味”直接长在母语的说话重音里，听懂说话的节奏，就能听出莫扎特和巴托克交响曲里的民间血统。","plain":"为什么不同国家的古典曲风差别巨大？伯恩斯坦点出规律：语言节奏决定民歌律动，民歌又长成古典交响曲。匈牙利语重音抢在第一音节，法语字字平均，此外如横跨中美欧的五声音阶，换个伴奏节奏就能在不同文化之间切换。","scenes":["伯恩斯坦现场用匈牙利重音、法语腔和西部牛仔拖腔对比不同民歌，随即接入巴托克和拉威尔段落，证明说话重音直接决定了旋律跌宕；又在钢琴只用五个音先后弹出中国风、苏格兰风与墨西哥印第安旋律。","邀请女高音玛妮·尼克松用方言演唱法国奥弗涅民歌，最后奏响艾夫斯《第二交响曲》终曲，让美国老民歌集体混战后用一个不协和大齐奏“Wow!”收场。"],"category":"文化与跨界","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1ay4y1z7Wu","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ay4y1z7Wu","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 音乐厅里的民间音乐","duration":"53:14","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/folk-music-concert-hall","repertoire":[{"composer":"Mozart","piece":"Symphony No. 39 in E-flat Major, K. 543 (3rd Movement)","titleZh":"第 39 交响曲小步舞曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mozart%20Symphony%20No.%2039%20in%20E-flat%20Major%2C%20K.%20543+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Mozart%20Symphony%20No.%2039%20in%20E-flat%20Major%2C%20K.%20543"},{"composer":"Bartók","piece":"Music for Strings, Percussion and Celesta","titleZh":"弦乐、打击乐与钢片琴音乐","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/ba/1b/02/ba1b028a-722b-bdcd-2ad2-4cd39cc8339c/mzaf_8383394697864570256.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/music-for-strings-percussion-and-celesta-sz-106-iii-adagio/895646051?i=895646077&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Berlin Philharmonic Orchestra & Herbert von Karajan","recordingTrack":"Music for Strings, Percussion and Celesta, Sz. 106: III. Adagio","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Bart%C3%B3k%20Music%20for%20Strings%2C%20Percussion%20and%20Celesta+Bernstein","biliSearc